"display: table-cell; white-space: nowrap; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"edgeLabel\"><p>NO</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g></g><g class=\"nodes\"><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-regulatory-compliance--is-this-entity-aml-atf-regulated-and-does-an-exemption-help-flowchart-START-0\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(488.5, 47)\"><rect class=\"basic label-container\" style=\"\" x=\"-130\" y=\"-39\" width=\"260\" height=\"78\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -24)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"48\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>Entity \u2014 is it AML/ATF-regulated?</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-regulatory-compliance--is-this-entity-aml-atf-regulated-and-does-an-exemption-help-flowchart-FI-1\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(488.5, 347)\"><polygon points=\"211,0 422,-211 211,-422 0,-211\" class=\"label-container\" transform=\"translate(-210.5, 211)\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -96)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"192\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>Does it carry on a relevant financial-business activity<br />(banking, trust, CSP, investment business, fund admin,<br />MSB, digital asset business, long-term insurance)?</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-regulatory-compliance--is-this-entity-aml-atf-regulated-and-does-an-exemption-help-flowchart-NONFI-3\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(293, 795)\"><polygon points=\"163,0 326,-163 163,-326 0,-163\" class=\"label-container\" transform=\"translate(-162.5, 163)\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -48)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"96\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>Is it a regulated non-financial business?<br />(real estate, dealers in high-value goods, gaming\u2026)</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-regulatory-compliance--is-this-entity-aml-atf-regulated-and-does-an-exemption-help-flowchart-OTHERSUP-5\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(138, 1243)\"><rect class=\"basic label-container\" style=\"\" x=\"-130\" y=\"-99\" width=\"260\" height=\"198\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -84)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"168\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>AML-supervised by another competent authority<br />(Superintendent of Real Estate, Gaming Commission\u2026)<br />\u2014 not the BMA. Out of this agent's lane.</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-regulatory-compliance--is-this-entity-aml-atf-regulated-and-does-an-exemption-help-flowchart-OUT-7\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(448, 1243)\"><rect class=\"basic label-container\" style=\"\" x=\"-130\" y=\"-75\" width=\"260\" height=\"150\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -60)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"120\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>Likely outside the AML/ATF perimeter \u2014<br />DOCUMENT the basis (the no-scope decision is itself a record)</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-regulatory-compliance--is-this-entity-aml-atf-regulated-and-does-an-exemption-help-flowchart-REG-9\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(839, 795)\"><rect class=\"basic label-container\" style=\"\" x=\"-130\" y=\"-75\" width=\"260\" height=\"150\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -60)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"120\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>AML/ATF-REGULATED FINANCIAL INSTITUTION<br />POCA 1997 + AMLR 2008 apply; BMA is the AML supervisor (SE Act 2008)</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-regulatory-compliance--is-this-entity-aml-atf-regulated-and-does-an-exemption-help-flowchart-EXEMPT-11\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(839, 1243)\"><polygon points=\"211,0 422,-211 211,-422 0,-211\" class=\"label-container\" transform=\"translate(-210.5, 211)\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -96)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"192\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>Does a LICENSING exemption apply?<br />(e.g. private trust company under the Trust Exemption Order 2002,<br />or a CSP-Act carve-out for an already-AML-regulated entity)</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-regulatory-compliance--is-this-entity-aml-atf-regulated-and-does-an-exemption-help-flowchart-STILLAML-13\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(684, 1651)\"><rect class=\"basic label-container\" style=\"\" x=\"-130\" y=\"-123\" width=\"260\" height=\"246\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -108)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"216\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>The licensing exemption does NOT remove AML/ATF obligations<br />\u2014 since 2018 exempt PTCs are still AML/ATF-regulated FIs.<br />Full CDD/EDD/MLRO/reporting still apply.</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g><g class=\"node default\" id=\"t-regulatory-compliance--is-this-entity-aml-atf-regulated-and-does-an-exemption-help-flowchart-FULLAML-15\" data-look=\"classic\" transform=\"translate(994, 1651)\"><rect class=\"basic label-container\" style=\"\" x=\"-130\" y=\"-75\" width=\"260\" height=\"150\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-100, -60)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"200\" height=\"120\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table; white-space: break-spaces; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center; width: 200px;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>Full licensee \u2014 AML/ATF obligations apply in full<br />(CDD/EDD, risk assessment, MLRO, SAR reporting to the FIA)</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g></g></g></g><defs><filter id=\"t-regulatory-compliance--is-this-entity-aml-atf-regulated-and-does-an-exemption-help-drop-shadow\" height=\"130%\" width=\"130%\"><feDropShadow dx=\"4\" dy=\"4\" stdDeviation=\"0\" flood-opacity=\"0.06\" flood-color=\"#000000\"/></filter></defs><defs><filter id=\"t-regulatory-compliance--is-this-entity-aml-atf-regulated-and-does-an-exemption-help-drop-shadow-small\" height=\"150%\" width=\"150%\"><feDropShadow dx=\"2\" dy=\"2\" stdDeviation=\"0\" flood-opacity=\"0.06\" flood-color=\"#000000\"/></filter></defs></svg>",
